# Implementation Plan: High-Performance AI Optimization & UX Enhancement

We are moving from a single-threaded, high-latency system to a high-speed, parallel, and proactive pharmaceutical linguistic engine.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> To support **Background Sayqallash**, the system will automatically consume AI tokens immediately after a document is uploaded. This ensures that when you open the editor, most corrections are already prepared.

> [!TIP]
> Switching to **Gemini 2.0 Flash** will significantly reduce the "waiting" time for manual corrections, offering near-instant feedback.

